From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:17:36 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] meshcore: add dedicated MeshCore tab

Add a MeshCore top-level destination, navigation graph, view model and Compose screen. The screen connects over USB or BLE, lists channels and contacts, and provides direct/group chat without merging MeshCore records into the Meshtastic UI.

